{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "The relations family fed by live PromQL against lgtm-prometheus, where Tempo's metrics-generator remote-writes the service graph. Two routes: a plain ranged query with an empty Transform tab, which draws every edge but gives them all one id; and an instant table reshaped with organize + rowsToFields, which gives each edge a name an override can address. Both are portable to any Prometheus with Tempo's metrics-generator behind it.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Relations charts from Prometheus\n\nTempo writes the metric `traces_service_graph_request_total{client, server}` to Prometheus. The `client` and `server` labels identify the endpoints of each service call.\n\nThe relations panel recognizes these endpoint label pairs:\n\n- `source` and `target`\n- `client` and `server`\n- `src` and `dst`\n- `from` and `to`\n\n## Route A: ranged series\n\nA time series query returns one `Value` field for each edge. The field keeps its `client` and `server` labels.\n\nThe panel reads those labels directly, so the Transform tab can stay empty. Calculation controls how the panel reduces each ranged field to one edge value.\n\n## Route B: instant rows\n\nAn instant table query returns one row for each edge. `label_join` creates an `edge` label such as `grafana-->prometheus`.\n\nUse Organize fields to put `edge` before the endpoint columns. Then use Rows to fields to create one named field for each edge.\n\nKeep the original endpoint labels when a query copies them to `source` and `target`. The panel uses their matching values to detect filter names.\n\nEach relations panel enables ad hoc filters. Pin a tooltip to add a filter to the Ad hoc filters variable."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "grafana-echarts-relations-panel",
      "title": "Route A — service dependency map, no transformations",
      "description": "This graph uses Route A. Each ranged `Value` field keeps its `client` and `server` labels, so the panel reads every edge without transformations.\n\nThe panel also uses these labels as the ad hoc filter names. The time slider selects one timestamp from the ranged data.\n\nThe query supplies no node fields, so the panel derives the nodes from endpoints. Derived nodes have no values to change with the slider.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 3,
          "filterable": true
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "editorMode": "advanced",
        "seriesType": "graph",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        },
        "relationsLayout": "circular",
        "relationsNodeSize": 18,
        "relationsShowNodeLabels": true,
        "relationsEdgeArrows": true,
        "relationsCurveness": 0.12,
        "relationsFocusAdjacency": true,
        "relationsTimeSlider": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (client, server) (\n  rate(traces_service_graph_request_total{client!=\"\", server!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval])\n)",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{client}}-->{{server}}"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "grafana-echarts-relations-panel",
      "title": "Route B — the same graph, with per-edge ids",
      "description": "This graph uses an instant table query. `label_join` creates a unique `edge` label, and Organize fields puts it first.\n\nRows to fields creates one field named `client-->server` for each edge. It keeps the `client` and `server` columns as labels for ad hoc filters.\n\nThe overrides can style or link one edge without changing the others. The query calculates one value over the selected range.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 3,
          "filterable": true
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "grafana-->prometheus"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "purple"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineType",
                "value": "dashed"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "prometheus-->prometheus"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 4
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.curveness",
                "value": 0.45
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "user-->grafana"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Traces into Grafana",
                    "targetBlank": true,
                    "url": "/explore?orgId=1&left=%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22lgtm-tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22lgtm-tempo%22%7D%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%7B%20resource.service.name%20%3D%20%5C%22grafana%5C%22%20%7D%22%7D%5D%2C%22range%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%22now-1h%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22now%22%7D%7D"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "editorMode": "advanced",
        "seriesType": "graph",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        },
        "relationsLayout": "circular",
        "relationsNodeSize": 18,
        "relationsShowNodeLabels": true,
        "relationsEdgeArrows": true,
        "relationsCurveness": 0.12,
        "relationsFocusAdjacency": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "label_join(\n  sum by (client, server) (\n    rate(traces_service_graph_request_total{client!=\"\", server!=\"\"}[$__range])\n  ),\n  \"edge\", \"-->\", \"client\", \"server\"\n)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "edge": 0,
              "client": 1,
              "server": 2,
              "Value": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rowsToFields",
          "options": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "grafana-echarts-relations-panel",
      "title": "Edges and node stats — two queries, two filtered chains",
      "description": "Query A creates named edge fields with the Route B transformations. Query B creates one node field for each server and sets its value to the failed-request ratio.\n\nEach transformation chain uses a query filter, so it changes only its own frames. The node query includes zero values for services with no failed-request series.\n\nNode thresholds show the error ratio. An edge override keeps edge units as requests per second and uses palette colors.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "filterable": true,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/-->/"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "reqps"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 3
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "palette-classic"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "editorMode": "advanced",
        "seriesType": "graph",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        },
        "relationsLayout": "force",
        "relationsNodeSize": 20,
        "relationsShowNodeLabels": true,
        "relationsEdgeArrows": true,
        "relationsCurveness": 0.12,
        "relationsFocusAdjacency": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        },
        "relationsRepulsion": 320,
        "relationsEdgeLength": 140,
        "relationsGravity": 0.08
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "label_join(\n  sum by (client, server) (\n    rate(traces_service_graph_request_total{client!=\"\", server!=\"\"}[$__range])\n  ),\n  \"edge\", \"-->\", \"client\", \"server\"\n)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "label_replace(\n  (\n    (\n        sum by (server) (rate(traces_service_graph_request_failed_total[$__range]))\n      or\n        sum by (server) (rate(traces_service_graph_request_total[$__range])) * 0\n    )\n    / sum by (server) (rate(traces_service_graph_request_total[$__range]))\n  )\n  and on (server)\n  sum by (server) (\n    sum by (client, server) (\n      rate(traces_service_graph_request_total{client!=\"\", server!=\"\"}[$__range])\n    )\n  ),\n  \"node\", \"$1\", \"server\", \"(.*)\"\n)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "filter": {
            "id": "byRefId",
            "options": "A"
          },
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "edge": 0,
              "client": 1,
              "server": 2,
              "Value #A": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "Value"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rowsToFields",
          "filter": {
            "id": "byRefId",
            "options": "A"
          },
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "filter": {
            "id": "byRefId",
            "options": "B"
          },
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "server": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "node": 0,
              "Value #B": 1
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #B": "Value"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rowsToFields",
          "filter": {
            "id": "byRefId",
            "options": "B"
          },
          "options": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "grafana-echarts-relations-panel",
      "title": "Span metrics: service → operation — sankey",
      "description": "This Sankey chart uses `traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service, span_name}`. Each edge connects a service to one server operation.\n\nThe query adds `source` and `target` labels. Its outer aggregation keeps `service` and `span_name` so the panel detects the ad hoc filter names.\n\nThe query keeps only server spans and limits the result to ten edges. The service and operation sets are separate, which makes the graph acyclic.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 3,
          "filterable": true
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "editorMode": "advanced",
        "seriesType": "sankey",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        },
        "relationsSankeyOrient": "horizontal",
        "relationsSankeyNodeAlign": "left",
        "relationsSankeyNodeWidth": 14,
        "relationsSankeyNodeGap": 6,
        "relationsSankeyLinkOpacity": 0.4,
        "relationsShowNodeValues": false,
        "relationsLinkColor": "source",
        "relationsFocusAdjacency": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(10,\n  sum by (source, target, service, span_name) (\n    label_replace(\n      label_replace(\n        sum by (service, span_name) (\n          rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}[$__range])\n        ),\n        \"source\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)\"\n      ),\n      \"target\", \"$1\", \"span_name\", \"(.*)\"\n    )\n  )\n)",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{source}}-->{{target}}"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "grafana-echarts-relations-panel",
      "title": "Call matrix — chord",
      "description": "This chord chart uses the Route A ranged query. It shows both directions between a pair as separate ribbons.\n\nMean calculates the average request rate over the selected time range. The `prometheus → prometheus` ribbon is a self-loop.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 3,
          "filterable": true
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "editorMode": "advanced",
        "seriesType": "chord",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        },
        "relationsChordPadAngle": 4,
        "relationsChordLinkOpacity": 0.5,
        "relationsLinkColor": "source",
        "relationsFocusAdjacency": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["mean"]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (client, server) (\n  rate(traces_service_graph_request_total{client!=\"\", server!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval])\n)",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{client}}-->{{server}}"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Route B before Rows to fields — why organize is not optional",
      "description": "This table shows the instant response before Route B transformations. Prometheus sorts label columns by name, and `Time` appears first.\n\nRows to fields uses the first string column as the field name. Use Organize fields to move `edge` first, remove unused columns, and rename endpoint columns when necessary.\n\nWithout that step, repeated client names can create duplicate fields that do not identify complete edges.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 49
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false
          },
          "decimals": 4
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": ["sum"],
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "lgtm-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "label_join(\n  label_replace(\n    label_replace(\n      sum by (client, server) (\n        rate(traces_service_graph_request_total{client!=\"\", server!=\"\"}[$__range])\n      ),\n      \"src\", \"$1\", \"client\", \"(.*)\"\n    ),\n    \"dst\", \"$1\", \"server\", \"(.*)\"\n  ),\n  \"edge\", \"-->\", \"src\", \"dst\"\n)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": []
    }
  ],
